@tnido7 shipped us his 2016 Z06 for our Stage 2 package. 

We didn’t disappoint.

His first message to me after it was delivered was “Omg this thing is insane hahaha”

That makes it all worth it right there!  I want to thank my expert team for knocking this one out of the park and @ddtech for the spot on ECU and TCM calibration.

Our Stage 2 C7 Z06 package includes:

@halltechsystems CAI
@kooksheaders 
@innovatorswest 18% lower
@mmsolutions catch can
@officialngksparkplugs plug set
@mobil1 Supercar Oil and Filter 
Professional Installation and Tuning- all done in house.

We also added an upgraded heat exchanger and reservoir from our friends at @cordes_performance_racing as well as billet blower lid, taller gen 2 bricks and 17+ hood liner to help avoid those out of control manifold temps with the 15/16 cars.

Baseline (k&n cai and corsa x pipe): 554/600 10psi
Results: 596/724 13 psi

Thank you Tomas, we appreciate your business.  Hope to see you again when you’re ready for more!
