In my work I see women carrying far too much of the fertility responsibility - despite that fact there is a growing body of evidence showing the impact that paternal and sperm health has on the ability to conceive, to stay pregnant, the health of pregnancy and the genetic impact on offspring. 

I’m so truely excited to be speaking at the Fertility4Men Virtual Summit on 24–25 October 2025. 

👉Focused entirely on men’s fertility, 
👉A wide ranging panel of speakers, 
👉Practical insights,
✌️Vibes 

I’ll be joining an incredible line-up of experts exploring this topic from every angle, and sharing my perspective on how we understand and support men’s role in conception from a TCM and natural medicine view, talking safety, what you might expect, what recent research has shown. 

💌 share with a friend (or sperm provider) who should check it out x

It’s free to join.  Check stories for a live link or link here: 

