🏆 🐅 SNETTERTON 300 @timeattack_uk CLUB 4WD P1 + LAP RECORD
⏱️ 1:58.523s History made in the GTR books
4 rounds. 4 wins. 4 lap records 🏆🏆🏆🏆 
🥇 First R35 GTR in Time Attack UK history to achieve this.

This isn’t luck this reflects the quality of our builds and the standard of our prep.
That’s how we represent the GTR community with results that can’t be ignored.

How we did it this time:

• 72 hours before race day, 🐅 GTR meticulously serviced and prepped this included transmission drop clean & rebuild the VOLKOV style 
• Upgraded transmission oil pump to VM spec, upgraded VM sensors and flow optimisation
• VOLKOV AWD control logic (RWD dominant, AWD on demand) did you know we currently develop and testing our own maps for Road/ Track and Drag applications 
• Final geometry recalibration by Alex @nitron_suspension dialled for perfect balance
• Full service & prep every psi, every detail chased
• VOLKOV aero + drivetrain strategy

VM Fast street engine 3.8L forged engine
VM built transmission including in house custom modified and improved FWD ETS unit we currently successfully testing 
VM spec Front and Rear LSD differential’s

