🏁 BRANDS HATCH INDY – NEW LAP RECORD | 🐅 Tiger GTR Takes P1 AGAIN @timeattack_uk 

Third race. Third win. Third lap record.
The VOLKOV Motors 🐅 Tiger GTR just became the quickest GTR to ever lap Brands Hatch Indy in Club 4WD setting a 49.3 second lap on @yokohamatire <redacted_mention> road legal tyre and taking home yet another P1 finish.

This blog captures the full story from arriving at the track, to the flat-out push that led to the record. No fluff just raw effort, precision engineering, and team execution at the highest level.

The 🐅 Tiger GTR is powered by our in-house VOLKOV 3.8L build fast street spec engine, featuring @linney_engineering Formula gear set many other components, @aprperformance GT2000 wing, @nitron_suspension R3 coilovers, <redacted_mention> tyres always fitted and ballanced to absolute perfection, @cicioperformance turbo kit, @dimitri_keramidas ECU/ TCM calibration to suit Road/ Drag and each Track in the UK, from/ transmission build to FWD ETS clutch setup, custom geometry and suspension tuning, full mechanical preparation handled personally by Alex Volkov. Every bolt, every parameter dialled in.

It’s the result of obsessive attention to detail and a proper team behind it. Big thanks to everyone who makes this possible from our sponsors to our VOLKOV crew behind the scenes. This is more than racing. This is a statement.

Next stop: Snetterton 300 – July 27.
Let’s keep pushing.

